      "description": "A quiet navigation row with a soft teal current-page state.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Example navigation\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.65 17.65l1.42 1.42M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.65 6.35l1.42-1.42\"/></svg><span>Today</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{width:188px;background:var(--sidebar,#eef1ef);padding:10px}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:10px 12px;width:100%;min-height:42px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:none;text-align:left;color:var(--muted,#5b6f71);font:400 12px/1.6 var(--ui,\"Inter\",sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),box-shadow 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),transform 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1))}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--faint,#e8edeb);color:var(--ink,#173d42)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page]{background:var(--accent-soft,#e5f1ef);color:var(--accent,#287e87);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#287e87);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none}}"
    },
